.TH SAVE_INIT 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
save_init \- Engine\-internal: resolve the save folder from org and app (creating it) or fall back to the working directory
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqsave.h\(dq
.BI "void save_init(Save *s, const char *org, const char *app);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Engine\-internal: resolve the save folder from org and app (creating it) or fall back to the working directory. Called by engine_init(); games never call it.
.SH MODULE
save (src/engine/save/save.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR engine_init (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
